Z||000000||Neal||10-02-2001||07:25 PM||||Any one heard of PVI - platinum vapour injection -<P>I was reading the newspaper and saw the add says its supposed to help your engine run more efficient and cleaner.<P>It basicly was a unit that injected a very small amout of platinum (vapour i imagine) and that is supposed to combust up to 22% more gas they were saying from 69% burn to 91%.<P>seemed pretty gimmicky to me, but you never know.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Mickey_Moose||10-02-2001||08:04 PM||||They were having some 'special' on it here in Edmonton with money back if not happy, so I tried it on my truck...result, it did improve my milage, but only 5% - took it back and got my money refunded.<P>Tim<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||artherd||10-03-2001||09:28 AM||||What's the theroey here, that it acts as a non-consumed (by defenition) catalyst?<P>Sounds... expensive.<P>And smells.... phoney.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000003||MontanaFiero||10-03-2001||11:36 AM||||I used it on my Chevy V-8, and on my Fiero with a 2.5 on a 1000 mile trip (until the damned thing broke off and melted on  my exhaust manifold).<BR>I got an increase of about 5 mpg on the fiero. You will either get more POWER or more EFFICIENCY, depending on how you drive.<P>Platinum is taken in through a vacuum line and coats the cylinder walls (or head) and creates a more complete burn of the fuels. It does the same job as the catalytic converter, but it does it in the combustion  chamber instead of the exhaust system. This way you actually benefit from the more complete burn.<P>If anything, it will make sure you pass smog, and it is smog legal in california.<P>Obtain it at 1-800-LESS GAS<BR>it costs somewhere around $100, but lasts for about 30,000 (unless it falls on your exhaust system.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/blee291/fiero/mtfieroplate.jpg"> ||||reg||1
